DESCRIPTION:Shorten further to 45–50 min easy spin at 120–135 W (pure Z
 2 floor)\, flat route\, stop immediately if HR exceeds 135 bpm — treat a
 s circulation/flush only\, not a training stimulus.\n\nReason: Body batter
 y recorded at 0–2 this morning indicates severe accumulated fatigue with
  the Half Oceanman only 7 days away\; any meaningful training load today r
 isks digging the hole deeper.\n\nAI coaching 2026-09-26
