SUMMARY:[AI ADJUSTED] running — Keep as planned: 25–30 min walk/jog at 
 7:30–8:00/km\, strictl
DESCRIPTION:Keep as planned: 25–30 min walk/jog at 7:30–8:00/km\, stric
 tly HR ≤125 bpm\; if body battery has not recovered above 40 by morning\
 , replace with a 20-min flat walk only.\n\nReason: With only one run in 4 
 weeks at very high HR and continuing low body battery\, even this easy jog
  should be gated on morning recovery status to avoid compounding fatigue 6
  days before the swim race.\n\nAI coaching 2026-09-26
END:VEVENT
