SUMMARY:[AI ADJUSTED] cycling — Cap at 35–40 min at 120–135 W (low Z2
  only)\, no intervals\, n
DESCRIPTION:Cap at 35–40 min at 120–135 W (low Z2 only)\, no intervals\
 , no tempo\; if legs feel flat after the weekend\, convert to full rest.\n
 \nReason: This falls only 4 days before the Half Oceanman 5\,000 m race 
 — any session above easy recovery intensity risks arriving at the start 
 line pre-fatigued.\n\nAI coaching 2026-09-26
END:VEVENT
