SUMMARY:[AI ADJUSTED] swimming — Reduce to 1\,200–1\,500 m total: 400 m
  easy warm-up\, 4×100 m a
DESCRIPTION:Reduce to 1\,200–1\,500 m total: 400 m easy warm-up\, 4×100 
 m at race pace (2:30/100 m) with 30 s rest\, 200–400 m easy cool-down 
 — no hard aerobic sets\; focus on feel and rhythm\, not volume.\n\nReaso
 n: A full 2\,000 m aerobic session 4 days before a 5\,000 m race will leav
 e residual muscular fatigue in the water\; a short sharpener preserves fee
 l without accumulating load.\n\nAI coaching 2026-09-26
END:VEVENT
