DESCRIPTION:Replace with 35–40 min easy run at 6:30–7:00/km\, HR ≤145
  bpm\, no intervals — this is 3 days post-Half Oceanman and 4 days pre-T
 reviso 10K\; treat as a gentle re-activation of running legs only.\n\nReas
 on: Running hard intervals 3 days after a 5 km open-water race and 4 days 
 before a 10K road race sandwiches the body between two stressors with no r
 ecovery buffer\, significantly increasing injury and underperformance risk
 .\n\nAI coaching 2026-09-26
END:VEVENT
