DESCRIPTION:Skip entirely — full rest day\; optional 10 min of gentle sta
 tic stretching and foam rolling only\, no loading.\n\nReason: Strength tra
 ining including jump and landing drills 2 days before the Treviso 10K will
  leave neuromuscular fatigue in the legs at the start line\, undermining r
 ace performance.\n\nAI coaching 2026-09-26
